WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.399 --> 00:00:05.154
Open Tools & settings, then Saved work & connection.

2
00:00:05.154 --> 00:00:07.297
Expand Backups and recovery.

3
00:00:07.297 --> 00:00:12.052
Create recovery copy on this device keeps a copy of the unfinished case on this computer.

4
00:00:12.052 --> 00:00:15.156
Choose Recover an unfinished case to see the recovery copies.

5
00:00:15.156 --> 00:00:21.483
Select a copy. The details show the case, when it was saved and what it holds.

6
00:00:21.483 --> 00:00:28.750
Choose Restore selected case. The unfinished draft returns to Workspace; nothing is issued.
